    <div class="sq">⚡ Quick Answer — How is ROI Calculated?</div>
    <p class="sa">
      To calculate ROI (Return on Investment), subtract your total initial investment cost from the final returned value to determine your <strong>Net Profit</strong>, divide that net profit by the total initial cost, and multiply by 100 to convert it into a percentage.
    </p>
    <div class="formula">ROI = ((Final Value - Initial Cost) / Initial Cost) × 100</div>
  </div>

